WEBVTT

00:07:27.485 --> 00:07:31.280
Things like tire temperature,
brakes, acceleration,

00:07:31.322 --> 00:07:33.115
it's absolutely incredible.

00:07:33.449 --> 00:07:35.993
It's also incredibly realistic.

00:07:36.035 --> 00:07:37.203
Look at this.

00:07:37.244 --> 00:07:40.623
Sometimes you can look at this and think
that could be real life.

00:07:41.582 --> 00:07:43.959
It's an immersive experience.

00:07:44.376 --> 00:07:47.171
When you're going down
that, kind of the back straight,

00:07:47.171 --> 00:07:50.299
you're traveling about
293 feet per second.

00:07:50.633 --> 00:07:54.345
The difference between making that corner

00:07:54.386 --> 00:07:56.555
and dropping back
and not being in the lead

00:07:56.597 --> 00:07:58.641
is a mere fraction of a second.

00:07:58.974 --> 00:08:02.144
You want to know: Are your tires
at the right temperature?